(1. Executive Overview) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The Human Capability Graph \(HCG\) is Syrka's persistent semantic representation of people, ) Tj
T*
(identities, institutions, employers, governments, programmes, courses, learning outcomes, ) Tj
T*
(skills, knowledge, capabilities, evidence, credentials, research, projects, technologies, ) Tj
T*
(occupations, opportunities, passports, mobility routes, and national strategies over time.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The HCG is not a social graph, an LMS graph, or a static taxonomy. It is the evidence-backed ) Tj
T*
(relationship layer that answers:) Tj
T*
() Tj
