(Appendix D - Graph validation rules) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Every CapabilityObservation must have ASSERTS, EVIDENCED_BY, HAS_CONFIDENCE, DERIVED_FROM, ) Tj
T*
(and ontology version references.) Tj
T*
(2. Every graph mutation must reference at least one canonical event.) Tj
T*
(3. No LMS-native ID may be used as canonical graph ID.) Tj
T*
(4. Sensitive edge types require visibility and policy metadata.) Tj
T*
(5. SUPERSEDES must point to an existing prior assertion.) Tj
T*
(6. Revoked credentials must not support current passport claims.) Tj
T*
(7. MATCHED_TO edges require score and explanation reference.) Tj
T*
(8. Direct Person -> Capability edges must be marked projection-only.) Tj
T*
(9. Every ontology concept node must reference an ontology version.) Tj
T*
(10. Replayed graph state must be checksum-comparable for deterministic projections.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
